Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:03:01.16,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Diante do desespero absoluto
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.46,0:03:05.16,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:11.71,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.96,0:03:16.51,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.31,0:03:19.77,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:22.39,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:27.64,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:31.94,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:37.61,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:42.84,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:45.33,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:50.75,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:53.85,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:59.10,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:02.51,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:06.34,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
